      <title>特斯拉时隔一年半再降价 最高降1万元 金九银十节点冲销量</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E6%97%B6%E9%9A%94%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4%E5%8D%8A%E5%86%8D%E9%99%8D%E4%BB%B7-%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E9%99%8D1%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83-%E9%87%91%E4%B9%9D%E9%93%B6%E5%8D%81%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E5%86%B2%E9%94%80%E9%87%8F/</link>
